{
  "name": "@line/atoms",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Line's logic atoms: common functional logic (validated submit, paginated query, multi-step flow...) written once as pure TypeScript state machines, each with a test kit that drives every state and event. Usecases and services compose them; Construct flags hand-written copies (LINE-ATOM).",
